.env
.env.local
node_modules
test-results
.web
__pycache__/*

# Keep the alembic migrations dir and config out of the backend image.
# Migrations are applied manually (direct SQL) because the alembic history is
# out of sync, and the container runs with RUN_MIGRATIONS_ON_START=0. Shipping
# the local `alembic/` dir makes Python resolve `import alembic` to it (a
# namespace pkg with no `util`), and shipping `alembic.ini` makes Reflex's
# startup `check_schema_up_to_date()` try to import alembic — both crash
# `reflex run`. Excluding them makes that check early-return.
alembic
alembic.ini
